<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Safidon | Safe Shifting Jind Haryana
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure zero scratches during Bike Transportation In Safidon?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We wrap every bike in a proprietary 4‑layer system: 80‑gsm bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, reinforced corrugated fiberboard, and weather‑proof stretch film. The bike is then secured on a hydraulic ramp trailer with ratchet lashings, and our drivers follow a strict no‑impact loading protocol, backed by IRDAI‑approved marine insurance for complete peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the step‑by‑step process to book a bike parcel from Safidon to another city online?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Start by visiting our website and entering your bike details for an instant quote. Confirm the pickup date, provide your address for doorstep collection, and choose optional full‑transit insurance. Our dispatch team schedules the hydraulic ramp truck, sends you a GPS tracking link, and you receive an IBA‑approved GST invoice after delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any size or model restrictions for bikes transported on your hydraulic ramp trailers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our trailers accommodate all standard two‑wheelers, from compact commuter bikes to heavyweight cruisers and sports motorcycles up to 250 kg GVW. Oversized custom builds may require a pre‑assessment, but the adjustable hydraulic ramp and customizable cradles ensure safe handling for virtually any bike within legal road dimensions.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the GPS tracking system work and can I receive real‑time updates?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each container truck is fitted with a satellite‑grade GPS unit that streams live coordinates to our central dashboard. Customers receive a secure link via SMS or email, allowing them to view the bike’s exact location, estimated arrival time, and receive milestone alerts such as loading, departure, and drop‑off.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is provided for Bike Transportation In Safidon and how do I claim if needed?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide 100 % declared‑value coverage under an IRDAI‑approved marine transit policy. In the unlikely event of damage, you file a claim within 48 hours, submit photos and the original invoice, and our claims team processes reimbursement within 7‑10 business days, ensuring no financial loss for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I use your service to book an IRCTC bike parcel or combine road and rail transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, we coordinate with Indian Railways for IRCTC bike parcel bookings when rail is preferred, but we recommend our dedicated road service for faster, scratch‑free delivery. Our team handles all paperwork, including e‑Way bills and rail consignment forms, ensuring seamless integration between road and rail logistics.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to schedule a bike transport request in Safidon?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid government‑issued ID, the bike’s registration certificate, a copy of the insurance policy (if any), and a signed consignment note. For corporate clients, a GST invoice is also required. Our pickup agents verify these documents on the spot to ensure compliance with IBA and transport regulations.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
